    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yona gwasissa mureeda NG'UTAMIIDA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu ghwahita ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA heeda Yona deaba iyeenya, ak gwayeesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'eada, una Ninawi, mujiineedida hawiin, ak girukwiidi ng'asheanda ghayi earukuneey.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghang'eat Yona ak gawa Ninawi gawuurji gidarukusiinda NG'UTAMIIDA. Nea Ninawi ea mujiineeda haw gil, neaweesiindaanyi gaba eawooji samwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat Yona ak gawa jeeda mujiini beata eaweeda asagi. Hean goojuur, “Eawooji haradam, Ninawi gajeehuuyda!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamwas fuga Ninawi ASEETA; hean gwaheeleesa giiluuldeaydeaba geat, ak gaba siisi akwa hang'weaka guniyajeega, gida ng'eada siida haw ea gagul dea mwanang'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwahita ng'asheanda heeda sugoocheanda Ninawi, ak ghang'eada uhuuda hoorgeadaanyi, ak gwajakta hang'daanyi, ak gookwealsa geaw guniyajeega, ak goopteada aba jeeda deareeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwarukuta giijasta jea eerukuta aba jeeda ng'eanyiida Ninawi, “Aba diigheanda sugoocheanda ea fuga hees: ak gilinyoo ea siida gil ea dugwa, ea gisilga, ghana ea nooga, mayghwaak eara gil; adaghwaak gil nea adaghwali beega, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak abeeda buuneesean ea diyeanga anung' gookwa hang'weaka guniyajeega, ak gooyeawusa ASEETA muuchi; daba siisi nung'waada ng'asheagaaschi munyas ea munyinda mida geatingaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwanal ng'eaha, gideaba ASEETA gwadeepa ghwayam geaw aba nyarastaanyi ng'waan, ak ea meeshealani?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean daah ASEETA gidasin gidayamda geat aba ng'asheega nyaawa munyas, ghwanung'waada ASEETA nyarasta ghayi rugu jea gwasima fugiga; ak ea mudu gwasin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
